Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Homepage: https://github.com/ashenamantha122/J26-CS-310
Description: LAAX adaptive eBPF endpoint agent (Component 1)
 Endpoint agent for managed Linux hosts in the LAAX hybrid enterprise-IoT XDR
 framework. Runs light tracepoints continuously and attaches deep kprobes per
 process when a threat confidence score crosses a threshold, without restart.
 Exports telemetry to the correlation engine (CSV, or Protocol Buffers over
 ZeroMQ with CURVE), accepts execve denials from the containment controller
 through an eBPF LSM hook, and keeps a hash-chained audit log.
 .
 Research prototype, SLIIT project J26-CS-310.
